<title>USA: Vitesse sets 3.0 mln shr offer.</title>
<headline>Vitesse sets 3.0 mln shr offer.</headline>
<dateline>CAMARILLO, Calif. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vitesse Semiconductor Corp said Monday it plans to offer 3 million shares of common stock, all by the company, to fund construction and equipment of a new wafer fabrication facility in Colorado Springs, Colo.</p>
<p>Part of the proceeds also will be used for general corporate purposes, including working capital, the company said in a statement.</p>
